==Strategy/Usage==
Cheetah Cat is the worst cat in the game. It has no speed, doesn't attack, and has a horribly long recharge, all on top of Single Target. Although it may have the cheapest cost, it can't even be used as a meatshield because all it will do is sit behind the [[Cat Base]]. To make things worse, it doesn't even have any [[Cat Combo]]s to redeem it. Bringing this Cat in [[Restriction Stage]]s that limit the number of Cats you can send out, such as [[Duel Stages Challenge|Duel Stages]] and [[Tag Arena Challenge|Tag Arena Stages]], is especially foolish, since you will fill the Cat Limit much quicker.

All it does is waste a slot in your lineup. Don't bring it.

