==Trivia==
*Cheetah Cat's Japanese name, Neko Chītā (ネコチーター), can be translated as either "Cheetah Cat" or "Cheater Cat". Since it can only be obtained by cheating, that may in fact be the joke.
*Although it appears in the English game files, the description and name are left untranslated.
*Cheetah Cat has several oddities:
**Excluding [[Ototo Corps#Iron Wall|Iron Wall Cat]], Cheetah Cat is currently the only unit to have no evolution, is the only unit to not attack, and is also the only unit to be unable to receive levels through any means at all.
**Iron Wall Cat, [[Meditation Cat (Special Cat)|Meditation Cat]], Cheetah Cat and [[Mamoluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Mamolan Pasalan]] are the only units with 0 speed.
**It is the cheapest unit in the game, costing only a single cent.
**It has the longest recharge in the game, with a recharge of slightly over '''11 minutes'''.
**It has the shortest range of any unit in the game, as well as the lowest damage and health at maximum level.
*The description contains random characters in it that appear to imitate [[wikipedia:Mojibake|mojibake]], an occurrence when different characters are displayed because an unintended character encoding system is used.

